<p>You strike your target with your melee or ranged weapon, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">160%, 176%, 189%, 200%, 210%</acronym> weapon damage as nature and inflicting additional effects based on your active vile poisons:</p><p></p><p>Numbing Poison - Reduces global speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17%, 23%, 27%, 30%, 32%</acronym> for 5 turns.</p><p>Insidious Poison - Applies a standard poison that deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">168, 217, 254, 285, 311</acronym> nature damage over 5 turns.</p><p>Crippling Poison - Places <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> talents on cooldown for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 4, 4, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>Leeching Poison - Heals you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">168, 217, 254, 284, 311.</acronym></p><p>Volatile Poison - Deals a further <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">101, 130, 152, 171, 187</acronym> nature damage to foes in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> ball.</p><p></p><p>Learning this talent in addition to the Throwing Knives talent allows you to learn the Venomous Throw talent, which can be used to throw poisoned daggers at your foes, but is put on cooldown when this talent is used.</p><p></p>